  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EISA - St&#xf6;d till Mozambique valprocess 2018/2019</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EISA- Support to Mozambique electoral process 2018/2019 - EISA- External Audit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med programmet var en mer trov&#xe4;rdig valprocess 2018/2019 genom ett f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrat engagemang av intressenter i processen. M&#xe5;len skulle uppn&#xe5;s genom politiska partiers mer effektiva roll i styrning och val&#xf6;vervakning, en f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad r&#xe4;ttslig och institutionell ram f&#xf6;r val och ett starkare medborgerligt engagemang i valprocessen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program was a more credible 2018/2019 electoral process through improved engagement of electoral stakeholders in the process. The objectives was to be achieved through an effective role played by political parties in governance and election monitoring, an improved legal and institutional framework for elections, and stronger civic engagement in the electoral process.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program was a more credible 2018/2019 electoral process through improved engagement of electoral stakeholders in the process. The objectives was to be achieved through an effective role played by political parties in governance and election monitoring, an improved legal and institutional framework for elections, and stronger civic engagement in the electoral process.</narrative>
  </description>
